      "text": "About      pin, scrub 0.5, end +=cards×vh — card stack deals out\nTracks     pin, scrub 0.6 — a book that opens, rotateY 0 → −180\nPrizes     pin, scrub 0.5, end +=2.6vh — curtains part, podium rises\n           third→second→first, trophy drops on bounce.out at 2.4,\n           confetti 3.1, plates 3.2, captions 3.3\nPartnership pin, scrub 0.5 — rows land in sequence, scroll up rewinds",
      "originalText": "About      pin, scrub 0.5, end +=cards×vh — card stack deals out\nTracks     pin, scrub 0.6 — a book that opens, rotateY 0 → −180\nPrizes     pin, scrub 0.5, end +=2.6vh — curtains part, podium rises\n           third→second→first, trophy drops on bounce.out at 2.4,\n           confetti 3.1, plates 3.2, captions 3.3\nPartnership pin, scrub 0.5 — rows land in sequence, scroll up rewinds",
