      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hero           .hero-float parallax y = −120 × data-speed, scrub 0.8;\n               .hero-content recedes from 40% top\nTicker         x 0% → −25%, scrub 1\nScrollProgress scaleX 0 → 1, start 0 → end \"max\", scrub 0.3\nSchedule       spine draws, scrub 1 — reads the TWEEN's progress,\n               not the trigger's, because with scrub the pole lags",
      "originalText": "Hero           .hero-float parallax y = −120 × data-speed, scrub 0.8;\n               .hero-content recedes from 40% top\nTicker         x 0% → −25%, scrub 1\nScrollProgress scaleX 0 → 1, start 0 → end \"max\", scrub 0.3\nSchedule       spine draws, scrub 1 — reads the TWEEN's progress,\n               not the trigger's, because with scrub the pole lags",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
