      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rulebook  ScrollTrigger.create({ onToggle }) drives setActive(id)\n          for the TOC. Deliberately NOT wrapped in matchMedia —\n          \"the contents must track the page even when nothing animates.\"\n          The one place scroll position feeds React state.\nRouteScroll  ScrollTrigger.refresh() for measurement only",
      "originalText": "Rulebook  ScrollTrigger.create({ onToggle }) drives setActive(id)\n          for the TOC. Deliberately NOT wrapped in matchMedia —\n          \"the contents must track the page even when nothing animates.\"\n          The one place scroll position feeds React state.\nRouteScroll  ScrollTrigger.refresh() for measurement only",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
