      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  SmoothScroll early-returns, so Lenis never instantiates and\n   window.__lenis stays undefined\n2  every animating component wraps its work in\n   gsap.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)\")\n   with mm.revert() cleanup\n3  CSS keyframes ship as motion-safe:animate-*, and .faq-answer\n   has its own @media override\n\nhtml { scroll-padding-top: 6rem } exists purely to serve the no-Lenis path.",
      "originalText": "1  SmoothScroll early-returns, so Lenis never instantiates and\n   window.__lenis stays undefined\n2  every animating component wraps its work in\n   gsap.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)\")\n   with mm.revert() cleanup\n3  CSS keyframes ship as motion-safe:animate-*, and .faq-answer\n   has its own @media override\n\nhtml { scroll-padding-top: 6rem } exists purely to serve the no-Lenis path.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
